["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Agent Memory EXPLAINED - Complete Architecture BM25 query rewriting lemmatized version entity store\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huggingface-agent-的记忆不是聊天记录-而是一套信息检索系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/020bddae50744d00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">29:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的記憶不是聊天記錄，而是一套信息檢索系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LLM 無狀態，記住你不能靠拉長聊天歷史。長期記憶要外置於會話：MEM0 用三個存儲、每輪抽取，檢索時把向量、關鍵詞、實體分加權，只取最相關的幾十條。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 架構</span><span class=\"tag\">長期記憶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 398: Donald Davidson on Mind vs. Body (Part One) token-token identity type-type identity anomalous monism nomological supervenience\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-pel-戴维森-理由就是原因-但心理事件无律可循/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc82805cf3652977-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>心理事件無律可循，自由意志與決定論才能並存</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴維森用 token 同一論回應心身問題：心理事件與物理事件是同一個事件，因果關係需要覆蓋律，但心理描述沒有嚴格定律，所以決定論與自由可以並存。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心身問題</span><span class=\"tag\">理由與原因</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Making of Osama bin Laden Wahhabi Mujahideen Muslim Brotherhood Tora Bora\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-historyhit-本-拉登的极端化是选择不是宿命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d26bd7867ed27f2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登不是天生極端：三次轉折把他推上聖戰路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本·拉登並非從小極端，而是沙特家族邊緣人；1979年麥加事件、阿富汗戰場和海灣戰爭三次轉折，才把他推上全球聖戰道路，且他始終更想推翻沙特王室而非單打美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐怖主義史</span><span class=\"tag\">基地組織</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of China’s Electric Vehicle Industry three bigs and three smalls township and village enterprise (TVE) 10 city thousand vehicle project Hefei model special purpose vehicle (SPV)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-chinatalk-中国电动车不是北京规划出来的-是地方政府用信贷买路权买出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/50cff70715a02b2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>中國電動車不是規劃出來的，是地方信貸買路權買出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這一集把中國車企崛起的功勞從中央產業政策手裡拿走一半：真正的引擎是地方政府拿貸款和股權換廠、企業家用關係繞開國企牌照，代價是今天誰也解不開的產能過剩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電動車</span><span class=\"tag\">地方政府</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Creative Problem-Solving (Without Giving the Answer) lantern consciousness yes space learning exploration scaffolding metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-parentmojo-孩子不需要你给出答案-只需要一个脚手架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>孩子事事請示，問題不在孩子而在完美主義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個四歲半男孩從幼兒園回來開始事事請示；他媽媽發現，放下完美主義、不直接給答案，孩子自己會解決問題的能力遠超她預期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">興趣驅動學習</span><span class=\"tag\">完美主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"697. The Troubles: Murder in Belfast (Part 1) The Troubles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-restishistory-北爱冲突不是宗教战争-而是人口与经济的零和博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>北愛衝突不是宗教戰爭，而是人口焦慮與零和博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國長期無視北愛內部的人口焦慮與經濟失衡，把問題留給街頭；1966年夏天倫敦人只關心世界盃時，阿爾斯特的暴力即將失控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">英國政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How TSMC Uses Old Fabs to Make New Chips cross-node utilization gate-all-around (GAA) back end of the line (BEOL) CoWoS FOUP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-asianometry-台积电用货车把旧厂改造成-ai-新产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b270b942de95cf3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>臺積電用卡車運半成品晶圓：AI 產能的秘密武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">臺積電利用 N5 與 N7 間超過 90% 的工具重疊，把臺南廠做了一半的晶圓用卡車運到臺中廠收尾，從而在 N5 轉 N3 期間騰出 AI 產能。AI 繁榮的地基，是一隊普通卡車。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">臺積電</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片產能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"179: 蒸餾風暴：一場無人公開談論的技術競賽 distillation reasoning model agent trajectory multi-teacher distillation behavior fingerprint\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-latetalk-蒸馏是灰色地带-但张一鸣说它只能逼近不能超越/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fa229ca57235ef6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>蒸餾是灰色地帶，但張一鳴說它只能逼近不能超越</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒸餾違反用戶協議卻未必構成侵權，是無人公開談論的灰色地帶。張一鳴拒絕字節蒸餾，理由是它只能逼近對手、無法超越，而代價是組織里走不確定路線的人得不到資源和認可。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI’s Head of Design: This is the best time in history to be a designer | Ian Silber blank box problem capability overhang building in public systems thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-lennys-设计师不是被-ai-取代-是终于被放大了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2bbdf8e3b6682214-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>設計師不是被 AI 取代，是終於被放大了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">調查顯示設計師是全 tech 最不開心的群體，但 OpenAI 設計負責人認為這是歷史上做設計師最好的時候——因為沒人有標準答案，今天開始的人反而有優勢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1349: Smallpox and mummies liquid-liquid phase separation (LLPS) intrinsically disordered region (IDR) biomolecular condensate RNA polymerase holoenzyme vaccinia virus factory synonymous substitution rate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-twiv-反疫苗古已有之-噬菌体凝聚体是转录调控核心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">2:03:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>反疫苗不是新現象：珍納原著裡就寫滿了罵他的話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本期揭示反疫苗運動與疫苗一樣古老；噬菌體SPO1通過液-液相分離凝聚體完成轉錄時相轉換；南美天花古DNA證實歐洲殖民傳播；閱讀衰退與AI生成內容威脅辨別力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Slavery Built the Roman Empire manumission verna servus poenae dispensator freedmen Pax Romana\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-ancients-罗马帝国是奴隶制的产物-无奴隶则无帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7ffc0e03b96daabb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬帝國不是靠軍團，是靠被奴役者撐起來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬的行政、軍隊、家務、工坊到礦場幾乎全靠被奴役者運轉；公元前146年迦太基陷落後奴隸制成為經濟引擎，奧古斯都停止擴張後靠生育自我複製。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">奴隸制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Risk in the US-Japan Yen Rescue carry trade forward premium puzzle Cakeism Treasury Convenience Yield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-patrickboyle-美国救日元不是为日本-是为自家万亿美债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">31:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>美國救日元不是為日本，是為自家萬億美債</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國28年來首次干預日元，官方說是幫盟友；真正的算盤是防止日本為保匯率拋售1萬億美元美債——那會推高美國自己的舉債成本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美債</span><span class=\"tag\">日元</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 128: Early Sufism tasawwuf fana antinomianism mihna al-Malamatiyya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-litandhist-苏菲主义不是低配版伊斯兰-是哈里发国的反弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae099525368458ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文學與歷史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>蘇菲主義不是低配版伊斯蘭，是哈里發國的反彈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲東方學家把蘇菲主義說成橫跨歐亞的神秘主義，現代西方推廣者稱它是「愛、和諧與美」的訊息——但它的根是徹底伊斯蘭的，與最初幾個哈里發國的文化史不可分割。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊斯蘭教</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇菲主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1101 - Aug 15 2026 BFI (beamforming feedback information) LUCA (last universal common ancestor) Balmer break CSA (community supported agriculture)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-skeptics-wi-fi-信号能认出你-而且不用你带手机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>Wi-Fi 信號能認出你，而且不用你帶手機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wi-Fi 5 起設備回傳的 BFI 是明文，誰在射頻範圍內架個接收器就能讀到；靠人體擾動信號識別個人，實驗準確率最高 99.5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">隱私安全</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1348: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MMR ACIP lyophilized PICO sterile insect technique RIG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-twiv-行政令里的谎言-拆mmr与汽水比喻都是伪科学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">55:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>行政令稱疫苗如汽水，拆MMR增針數：每句都是謊言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「金標準」行政令裡每句話都被稱為謊言：拆開MMR增加針數、疫苗如汽水、Merck拒絕，CDC新局長將面臨站隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">MMR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 265: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 2 The Omega Point omega point Church principle Kardashev scale unitarity CCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-tokcast-宇宙的终点不是热死-而是被无限次驾驶回正轨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>宇宙的終點不是熱死，而是被無限次駕駛回正軌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tipler 的 omega point 理論被他自己誇張的宗教主張毀掉了，但 Deutsch 說裡面有一個有價值的核心：宇宙必須被持續駕駛，才能在有限時間裡完成無限計算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙學</span><span class=\"tag\">物理哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"361: Bacteria and Colon Cancer Recurrence bowel prep collagenase type IV pilus MAT protein\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-thisweekinmicr-大肠癌手术前的抗生素清肠-可能恰好在替促癌细菌做筛选/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b2f5ae26988f1a6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>大腸癌手術前的抗生素清腸，可能恰好在替促癌細菌做篩選</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大腸癌手術前的抗生素清腸本為預防感染；可復發者腸道里的耐藥菌對它無動於衷，手術日細菌總量反而是非復發者的23倍。清腸也許正是在為未來的復發做篩選。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">結直腸癌</span><span class=\"tag\">腸道菌群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"492 劉怡、于傑談保羅·沃爾克與現代美聯儲制度的形成 Triffin dilemma Bancor Eurodollar market Volcker shock\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cn2aa250-美联储不是天生精密-它该干什么到1970年代还在摸索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>美聯儲不是天生精密：它該幹什麼到1970年代還在摸索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲主席在1970年代前連該幹什麼都說不清，總統直接下令降息保就業。沃爾克把利率推到超過20%硬扛通脹，也立起了「主席只看通脹和失業」的現代模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span><span class=\"tag\">通貨膨脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky Eating &amp; Food Guilt with Jennifer Anderson embodied independence hyper-palatable foods PSAE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-raisinggh-挑食焦虑的解药-不评判-不奖励-甜点也是普通食物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9372f4ec9923f201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>挑食焦慮的解藥：不評判，不獎勵，甜點也是普通食物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子與食物的關係不取決於吃沒吃某樣東西，而在家長是否把食物分成好壞、是否用甜點當獎勵、是否允許自己按孩子的真實需要餵養；挑食信號越早識別越容易改變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童餵養</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why straight dating feels bleak heteropessimism hopeful pessimism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-grayarea-异性恋悲观主义-直女困境的真实与表演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d1e3cbb8f9e58a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>直女約會悲觀不是矯情，是政治倒退與經濟依附</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Jones 認為，直女對約會男性的尷尬與悲觀，既是真實感受也是表演，背後是政治倒退、經濟依附與社交媒體強化的複雜現實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">異性戀悲觀主義</span><span class=\"tag\">性別政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Historic El Niño Is Coming That Could Cost the World Trillions ENSO Teleconnection RONI Level effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-oddlots-厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击-而是永久性增长损失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>厄爾尼諾不是短期衝擊，而是永久性增長損失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">厄爾尼諾不只是短期天氣衝擊，研究顯示它會永久壓低經濟增長軌跡，一次強厄爾尼諾五年內可造成數萬億美元損失，且我們並未適應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lindy Teammate: Flo Crivello on Multiplayer Agents, Memory &amp; Why He&#x27;d Ban the Chinese Models He Uses hydration context bucket centary tree TOON hypothesis driven retrieval per-user LoRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cogrev-lindy-全线跑在-deepseek-上-创始人主张封禁中国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde4d0762bd9b4a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>Lindy 全線跑 DeepSeek，創始人卻主張封禁中國模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flo Crivello 說 Lindy 的 agent 現在整條鏈路的 driver 就是 DeepSeek，而他同時主張全行業一起被禁——因為競爭對手會用，他就不得不用，寧願協調解決這個囚徒困境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 記憶</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"SK hynix and the HBM Revolution HBM TSV TC-NCF MR-MUF HBM-PIM ADR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-asianometry-sk-hynix-靠-hbm-翻身-客户战略赢过周期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/143ca5977a616036-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>SK hynix 翻身靠的不是 HBM 技術，而是客戶關係</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SK hynix 的翻身不是押中 HBM 技術，而是押中客戶關係與長期投入；Samsung 押注 PIM 邊緣推理，恰好把 ChatGPT 時刻的唯一供應商位置讓給了對手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Chess.com Teaches US About Superhuman Capabilities, with CEO Erik Allebest Stockfish Leela Chess Zero mittens bot ELO secondary\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-nopriors-ai-让国际象棋变无聊后-又让它更好看了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdff3faf801808d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓國際象棋變無聊後，又讓它更好看了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Stockfish 時代棋手模仿完美引擎，比賽變得沉悶；神經網絡引擎下出激進非常規的棋，反而把人類棋力推得更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國際象棋</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 與人類技能</span>\n</div></div></a>"]